# The Game Boy Color's palettes for a DMG cartridge (side track I, phase 3):
# what the PS app (platform/ps/gbc_palette.zig) writes into Gb.Loader's
# palette window while the core is held, played on the PS link by the
# harness (ci-gbc, ci-arty-gbc; format: platform/sim/ps.zig). BG 0 =
# palette 28, OBJ 0 = palette 4, OBJ 1 = palette 5 of the boot ROM's
# table, so a mix-up of the three shows; with dmg-acid2 the screen equals
# test/golden/rgb/dmg-acid2-gbc.png (the spec with the same palettes).
hold 1
bytes 0x140030 FF7F8C7E007C0000FF7F1F42F21C0000FF7F94524A290000
hold 0
